From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM_AARCH64: include string.h for memset

The AArch64 port clears the initial FPU context with memset when
configUSE_TASK_FPU_SUPPORT is 2. Include its declaration so this
configuration builds with compilers that reject implicit declarations.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 portable/GCC/ARM_AARCH64/port.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/portable/GCC/ARM_AARCH64/port.c b/portable/GCC/ARM_AARCH64/port.c
--- a/portable/GCC/ARM_AARCH64/port.c
+++ b/portable/GCC/ARM_AARCH64/port.c
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@
 
 /* Standard includes. */
 #include <stdlib.h>
+#include <string.h>
 
 /* Scheduler includes. */
 #include "FreeRTOS.h"
